{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17748","headline":"赠浑钜中允 · 杨巨源","name":"赠浑钜中允","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公子髫年四海闻，城南侍猎雪雰雰。\n马盘旷野弦开月，鴈落寒原箭在云。\n曾向天西穿虏阵，惯游花下领儒羣。\n一枝琼萼朝光好，彩服飘飘从冠军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}